                  "action": {
                    "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
                    "params": {
                      "text": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.25em;\">White privilege outrage</span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:1em;\"><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/mediawatch/episodes/white-privilege-outrage/9972296\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.abc.net.au/mediawatch/episodes/white-privilege-outrage/9972296</a></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n"
                    },
                    "subContentId": "33557d35-2be1-4e2d-b248-b1199c866a19",
                    "metadata": {
                      "contentType": "Text",
                      "license": "U",
                      "title": "Untitled Text"
                    }
                  },
                  "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
                  "backgroundOpacity": 0,
                  "displayAsButton": false,
                  "buttonSize": "big",
                  "goToSlideType": "specified",
                  "invisible": false,
                  "solution": ""
                },
                {
                  "x": 4.453325720810733,
                  "y": 36.31442426976429,
                  "width": 91.04196403083071,
                  "height": 52.40036088868839,
                  "action": {
                    "library": "H5P.ExportableTextArea 1.3",
                    "params": {
                      "index": 0,
                      "exportNotSupported": "Export not supported on your device",
                      "exportComments": false,
                      "label": "<p style=\"text-align:left;\">After watching this clip, write a brief reflection (max 100 words) on how you think this style of media reporting may impact on Indigenous Peoples watching it, and what this skewed and ‘othering’ style of journalism may do to peoples’ ability to access health services.</p>\n"
                    },
                    "subContentId": "24a9d7ad-0452-498b-b456-e2dfd4db4bc2",
                    "metadata": {
                      "contentType": "Exportable Text Area",
                      "license": "U",
                      "title": "Untitled Exportable Text Area"
                    }
                  },
                  "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
                  "backgroundOpacity": 0,
                  "displayAsButton": false,
                  "buttonSize": "big",
                  "goToSlideType": "specified",
                  "invisible": false,
                  "solution": ""
                }
              ],
              "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
            },
            {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "x": 4.110762203825293,
                  "y": 1.8044434419758657,
                  "width": 91.61290322580645,
                  "height": 78.9444005864441,
                  "action": {
                    "library": "H5P.ExportableTextArea 1.3",
                    "params": {
                      "exportNotSupported": "Export not supported on your device",
                      "exportComments": false,
                      "index": 0,
                      "label": "<p>Also, after watching this video:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Try to think of media reports or discourses that you have seen that are further examples of ‘problematising’ of Indigenous Peoples. You will not need to search far in mainstream media to find numerous examples of this.</li>\n\t<li>Consider what may be the motivation behind the negative focus of these reports. How for example has mainstream media reported institutionally driven deaths of Indigenous Australians in the health and justice systems?</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Input your response below.</p>\n"
                    },
                    "subContentId": "aff766e5-05fa-4f13-ba59-38ee48367cec",
                    "metadata": {
                      "contentType": "Exportable Text Area",
                      "license": "U",
                      "title": "Untitled Exportable Text Area"
                    }
                  },
                  "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
                  "backgroundOpacity": 0,
                  "displayAsButton": false,
                  "buttonSize": "big",
                  "goToSlideType": "specified",
                  "invisible": false,
                  "solution": ""
                },
                {
                  "x": 3.9965743648301455,
                  "y": 80.29773316792601,
                  "width": 91.4987153868113,
                  "height": 18.79627833540092,
                  "action": {
                    "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
                    "params": {
                      "text": "<ul>\n\t<li>There have been a number of recent deaths of Indigenous People as a direct result of racism within  health services. See if you can find a media report of one of these preventable deaths recently within mainstream media, and bring it along to your tutorial this week.</li>\n</ul>\n"
                    },
                    "subContentId": "cbd27cab-9a52-45de-8870-c29304bf25c7",
                    "metadata": {
                      "contentType": "Text",
                      "license": "U",
                      "title": "Untitled Text"
                    }
                  },
                  "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
                  "backgroundOpacity": 0,
                  "displayAsButton": false,
                  "buttonSize": "big",
                  "goToSlideType": "specified",
                  "invisible": false,
                  "solution": ""
                }
              ],
              "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
            },
