                  "width": 93.94427633457036,
                  "height": 20.299988722228484,
                  "action": {
                    "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
                    "params": {
                      "text": "<p>Now watch this YouTube On Working with Aboriginal Clients, where Aboriginal Health Worker, Phyllis Winmar provides some guidelines for health and  social work professionals when working with her people. Phyllis reinforces and applies much of your learning so far in this unit and provides some practical tips that can help you as you reflect on decolonising your practice.</p>\n"
                    },
